This directory is created by luci-app-nft-ttl so OpenWrt/firewall4 systems that expect
/etc/nftables.d do not fail when adding nft include files.

The service generates dynamic rules at:
  /tmp/nftttl_rules.nft
and, for debug/backup when persist_file=0:
  /etc/nftables.d/nftttl.generated.disabled

Do not manually edit nftttl.generated.disabled. Change /etc/config/nftttl or the LuCI page instead.
